-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope of this licence

This MIT licence covers this directory's OWN content (userland/packages in
amix): the package recipes (package.sh, build.sh, prototype, tests, READMEs),
our own sources in <name>/src/, tools/, and the documentation.

It does NOT cover:

  * acompat/ (the libamixcompat library) -- first-party, but BSD-2-Clause; see
    acompat/LICENSE.
  * */patches/ -- changes to upstream programs; each patch is offered
    under the licence of the program it modifies.
  * Any packaged upstream program, its source, or the binaries built from it.
    Those keep their own licences, which travel inside each package (the
    licence text under <prefix>/doc/<tool>/, and the pkginfo record), and are
    named per package in <name>/package.sh (LICENSE, an SPDX identifier).
    No upstream source tree is vendored here; recipes fetch at build time.
  * Any file that names a different licence in its own header.
